  "title": "Im Kino oder ins Kino?",
  "subtitle": "Two-way prepositions: Wo? takes the dative, Wohin? takes the accusative",
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "type": "overview",
      "label": "Überblick",
      "title": "Lesson intro",
      "minutes": 40,
      "learn": [
        "Wo? means someone or something stays: dative. Wohin? means movement: accusative.",
        "in, an, auf, vor, hinter, über, unter, neben and zwischen take both cases.",
        "Contractions: in + dem = im, an + dem = am, in + das = ins, an + das = ans.",
        "On the ward: im OP is a place. In den OP is the way there."
      ],
      "vocab": [
